{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13543","headline":"古远行 · 元季川","name":"古远行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"悠悠远行者，羁独当时思。\n道与日月长，人无茅舍期。\n出门万里心，谁不伤别离。\n纵远当白发，岁月悲今时。\n何况异形容，安须与尔悲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元季川","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13543.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13543","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}